          "text": "A Machine Can't Be Due",
          "size": 78,
          "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
        },
        {
          "text": "A slot machine does not track your history. A no-payout streak means only that you had a bad run, not that spin 201 is due to hit — each spin is independent and decided separately.",
          "size": 46,
          "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
        },
        {
          "text": "History affects only your memory. The odds on the next spin stay the same.",
          "size": 46,
          "color": "rgb(52, 211, 153)"
