          "text": "Your Long-Run Cost, Not a Promise",
          "size": 78,
          "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
        },
        {
          "text": "A 95% RTP slot has a 5% house edge. Over time, that is about $5 lost for every $100 you wager, even though any single session can move either way.",
